
LEVEL4 {BloX: configurable options}

 The level every new game begins at. Higher starting levels
 mean faster falling pieces from the first block.

STARTLVL {Starting level for new games? 1} N 1 30

 The hard drop (SPACE bar) slams the falling piece straight to
 the floor for 2 bonus points per row. Answer NO to disable it.

HARDDROP {Allow the hard drop? YES} B

 The ghost piece is a faint outline at the bottom of the field
 showing where the falling piece would land.

GHOSTPC {Show the ghost piece? YES} B

 The Next window shows players which piece is coming after the
 one now falling.

SHOWNEXT {Show the Next piece preview? YES} B

 When enabled, BloX sends terminal bells for line clears, level
 ups, and game over. Players with quiet terminals hear nothing.

SOUNDS {Send sound effects (terminal bells)? YES} B

 Bonus points added to a player's first game of each calendar
 day. Set to 0 to disable the daily bonus.

DLYBONUS {Daily first-game bonus points? 0} N 0 100000

 Games scoring below this many points stay out of the Hall of
 Fame (lifetime statistics still count). Keeps the board
 meaningful.

MINSCORE {Minimum score for the Hall of Fame? 500} N 0 1000000

